      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but my doctor is never available and it’s like a weekend so i cant really reach them right now. i've taken sudafed before when i wasn't on the antipsychotics and it was totally fine. do u think there's a major reason why it would be a problem if i just took one or two of the regular strength ones? i just really need to clear my head so i can work.",
